      "text": "This itinerary takes you through three sides of Belize. Start among the jungles and rivers around Lamanai Outpost Lodge, then head to Caye Caulker and Hol Chan Marine Reserve. Continue to Western Belize to visit Actun Tunichil Muknal Cave, and finish with several days by the Caribbean Sea on the Placencia Peninsula."
